          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Attempts at Reconciliation</strong><br>\nThere have been several attempts at reconciliation between Hamas and the rival Fatah party, which controls the West Bank. These attempts aimed to form a unity government and to overcome the division between the two territories. So far, these efforts have been largely unsuccessful, although the dialogue continues.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Future Prospects</strong><br>\nThe future of Hamas and their role in the Israeli-Palestinian conflict remains uncertain. The ongoing blockade of the Gaza Strip and the continuing military confrontations with Israel present significant obstacles to a possible political solution. It is unclear how the relationships between Hamas, Israel, and other regional actors will evolve.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Summary</strong><br>\nHamas is a complex organization with many different facets. Their role as either terrorists or freedom fighters largely depends on perspective. Their actions and the reactions to them have far-reaching impacts on the region and the people who live there.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
